  (text "REV 9 ETHERNET MDI (tools/ethernet_mdi.py schematic): CM4 PHY pairs -> T1 H5007NL -> J3 RJ45 (T568).\nch1..ch4 = Pair3, Pair1, Pair2, Pair0; P on TDk-/MXk- (both winding ends swapped = polarity kept).\nTCTx: 100 nF each to GND (voltage-mode PHY, never shorted). MCTx: 75R Bob Smith -> 1 nF/2 kV -> ETH_SHIELD.\nETH_SHIELD = In1/In2 island + J3 shield, 1M || 1 nF/2 kV to GND. 100R diff W0.165/S0.125 (mdi_impedance.py)."
