  (text "REV 17 POWER SEQUENCING (tools/power_sequencing.py): J1-99/92/100 are module-specific (RPi GLOBAL_EN/RUN_PG vs\nRK817/RK806 PWRON key / RESETB). DEFAULT (RADXA RK3566/RK3576/RK3588) BUILD: U7, R54, R55 DNP -> nothing drives or\npulls up J1-92/99/100. RPI_CM4 BUILD: fit U7 + R54 (GLOBAL_EN hold-off < 4.38 V) and R55 (RUN held until PWR_OK), DNP R51.\nU8 TPS3808G01: PSEQ_PWR_OK = +3V3_SYS > 2.91 V nom (R52/R53) + 20 ms; VDD = always-on +5V_IN via R56 10R.\nR54/R55/R56 0603 bridge the +3V3_OUT trace (J1-84/86 -> U6 MAX809 VCC). Rule R17-1: no BootROM load on +3V3_SYS."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 25.4 71.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e7e90017-325d-60e3-26d1-9a9cfbeff257")
